{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The spade connector assortment fits the small electronics fasteners I recently chose because it could help me assemble or repair electrical connections.",
    "The epoxy and general-purpose heat shrink tubing fit my interest in practical DIY supplies, although I would need a specific repair or wiring project before buying them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Magnetic hooks help me hang things; their magnetic attachment does not make an angle gauge useful to me. I also have no current task requiring a feeler gauge or steel mesh.",
    "The COVID tests and exam gloves do not follow from my recent workshop needs. Twelve wastebaskets and a thousand gloves are quantities I have no reason to buy."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat workshop supplies as interchangeable, even though hanging, fastening, measuring, and electrical repair serve different purposes.",
    "My purchases of hardware assortments seem to have been taken as interest in large packs generally, but having several useful fastener sizes is different from needing many identical wastebaskets."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The useful connection between my recent purchases is practical fastening, hanging, and small assembly work; a shared material or magnetic feature alone is not enough.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear use. General repair supplies can interest me without prompting a purchase, and specialized marine-grade tubing needs a project I have not indicated."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my practical DIY interests but stretched them into tools, specialized materials, and bulk supplies without a clear current use."
}"}
